        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='71125' id='18' type-v2='text' w='24500' x='72700' y='22375'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='12'>Key Insights</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Optimal Communication Channel:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Æ </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Cellular</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> contacts are significantly more effective, yielding a </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>55.3% conversion rate</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>, which is double that of traditional telephone contacts (27.7%).</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Engagement Quality</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> Longer call durations are a strong predictor of success. Conversion rates climb steadily as call duration increases, peaking at </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>66.9%</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> for the longest interactions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Conversion Efficiency:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> The overall campaign maintains a strong conversion rate of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>47.38%</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> across a total customer base of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>11,162</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Summary:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Prioritize Cellular:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Shift marketing resources away from landlines toward cellular contact strategies.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Targeting Strategy:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Focus outreach on students and retirees, as they demonstrate higher receptivity to these campaigns.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#3b7600' fontname='Arial Narrow'>Quality over Quantity</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'>:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontname='Arial Narrow'> Encourage deeper engagement during calls, as duration is a primary driver for closing conversions.</run>
